      "type": "related_content",
      "attributes": {
        "id": 1021,
        "relationship_type": "related",
        "body": "Both relate to expressing extent, but with different emphasis. は～くらいです highlights something as the only or most notable case, like 'about the only (A) is (B)', e.g. できるのは田中さんくらいです ('Mr. Tanaka's about the only person who can do it.') ほど expresses extent or intensity, e.g. 驚くほど静かだった ('It was quiet to a surprising degree.')",
